---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-border/50">
  <div
    class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col gap-8 px-6 py-12 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <img src="/brand/logo_simbolo_gold.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24" />
        <span class="font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-wide">GymLab</span>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-xs text-sm text-muted">
        Entrena con un plan. Mira tu progreso.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted/70">© {year} GymLab</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm sm:flex-row sm:gap-8" aria-label="Legal y contacto">
      <a class="text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent" href="/privacidad">Privacidad</a>
      <a class="text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent" href="/terminos">Términos</a>
      <a class="text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent" href="mailto:gymlab@gymlab.dev">
        Contacto
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>
